soajs.oauth2

Ported from node-oauth2-server 2.4.1 (https://github.com/oauthjs/node-oauth2-server):
lib/oauth2server.js, lib/authorise.js, lib/grant.js, lib/error.js, lib/token.js, lib/runner.js,
and from basic-auth 0.0.1 (the Basic authorization header parsing).

